sequenceDiagram
    participant P1 as Process 1
    participant P2 as Process 2
    participant R as Redis

    P1->>R: SET lock:job token1 NX PX 30000
    R-->>P1: OK (acquired)
    P2->>R: SET lock:job token2 NX PX 30000
    R-->>P2: nil (held by P1)
    Note over P1: Exclusive work
    P1->>R: Lua release if GET==token1 then DEL
    R-->>P1: released
    P2->>R: SET lock:job token2 NX PX 30000
    R-->>P2: OK (acquired)
